    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d269">

                <pb facs="0561" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg437"/>

                <head>No. 265.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Morton</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 2,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ascertain promptly, and advise by telegraph to-morrow, whether, and at what time
                    we may expect revocation of edict prohibiting importation of American pork.
                    Important.</p>
                <closer><signed>BLAINE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
